error[missing-interface]: `Countdown` misses `length(::Countdown)` of iteration interface
  --> src/MissingInterfacePositive.jl:37:8
   |
37 | struct Countdown
   |        ^^^^^^^^^ first call to missing method throws
...
41 | Base.iterate(countdown::Countdown, count::Int = countdown.start) = count < 1 ? nothing : (count, count - 1)
   | ------------ `iterate` makes it iterator
   |
   = why: `IteratorSize` is `HasLength`, so `collect` calls `length(::Countdown)`
   = fix: define `Base.length(::Countdown)`, or `Base.IteratorSize(::Type{<:Countdown}) = Base.SizeUnknown()`   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain missing-interface

